# Local-dev skills root. The host resolves GERRIT_AGENT_SKILLS_ROOT, else this
# symlink to a sibling gerrit-agent-skills checkout. It is environment-specific
# and would dangle in a clone-only checkout, so it is not tracked. A missing
# link simply degrades the host to tools-only.
.claude/skills
